# Production Environment Variables

## Firebase Configuration
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=suvana-97279
FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL=firebase-admin@your-project.iam.gserviceaccount.com
FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY=-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----\nMIIEvQIBADANBgkqhkiG9w0BAQEFAASCBKcwggSjAgEAAoIBAQC...\n-----END PRIVATE KEY-----\n

## Admin Credentials
ADMIN_USERNAME=admin
ADMIN_PASSWORD=change_me_to_a_secure_password

## Backend Server
NODE_ENV=production
PORT=8080

## Frontend Configuration
VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-url.run.app
VITE_BASE_URL=https://your-project.firebaseapp.com

## Optional: Firebase App Check
# FIREBASE_APP_CHECK_DEBUG_TOKEN=debug-token-for-local-testing

## Notes:
# 1. Replace 'your-firebase-project-id' with your actual Firebase project ID
# 2. Get FIREBASE_CLIENT_EMAIL and FIREBASE_PRIVATE_KEY from Firebase Console → Project Settings → Service Accounts
# 3. Set strong ADMIN_PASSWORD - use a secure password generator
# 4. VITE_API_URL is the Cloud Run URL for your backend
# 5. VITE_BASE_URL is your Firebase Hosting URL
